    "scope": "Complete bounded project visualization: eleven existing independently modeled support buildings plus a new planned2024summit enclosure and seven-mirror telescope. Planned design is not an as-built or operating current enclosure. Exact source summit registration, roof/shutter/mount sections and hidden machinery are original estimates. Whole engineering/excavation census, two tiny unassigned source shed outlines and temporary site items are outside this bounded characteristic-building scope. Original member dates and individual placements remain; ensemble is illustrative, not a certified simultaneous site state. No old member geometry, terrain, sections or QA changed."
